msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Sejas modeļi"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Jūsu sejas momentuzņēmumi, ar kuriem salīdzināms Ubuntu Hello. Saglabājiet "
"vismaz divus, kas ierakstīti atšķirīgā apgaismojumā."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Tiek rādīti saglabātie modeļi:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Reģistrēts tikai viens sejas modelis. Brilles, bārdas izmaiņas vai citāds "
"apgaismojums maina to, kā kamera redz jūsu seju, tāpēc viens modelis var "
"neizdoties (piemēram, vakarā lampu gaismā). Pievienojiet otru modeli ar "
"brillēm vai bez tām, ar savu otru izskatu vai citā gaismā, lai atbloķēšana "
"paliktu uzticama."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Pievienojiet otru modeli"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Modeļi"

#: src/main.ui:261
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

